    "feat2Desc": "Drop secret albums, behind-the-scenes content, or early releases that only token holders can access. Your superfans pay a premium — and they love it because they feel like VIPs.",
    "feat3Title": "Fill Your Shows & Blow Up Your Streams",
    "feat3Desc": "Promote directly to fans who actually care about your genre, your vibe, your sound. No wasted ad spend. Every dollar targets the listeners most likely to hit play, follow, and buy tickets.",
