    "feat4Desc": "A community rating system means listeners never wade through garbage. If your track scores 6+ points, it gets featured. High quality = more plays = more money in your pocket.",
    "feat5Title": "Level Up with Pro Guidance & Collabs",
    "feat5Desc": "Get matched with producers, vocalists, and industry mentors. This isn't just a platform — it's a launchpad. The connections you make here become the collaborations that define your career.",
